(PROTOCOL T009) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Type 1 Diabetes Closed Loop Trial) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Version 1.0. Summary for recruitment matching. Not a medical diagnosis.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. BACKGROUND) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(T009 studies people with Type 1 diabetes. The study question is closed-loop insulin) Tj T*
(device training.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Sites keep usual clinic care unless the protocol names a change. Coordinators record) Tj T*
(visits and safety events.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This document is long so retrieval can split background, criteria, visits, and safety) Tj T*
(into separate chunks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. OBJECTIVES) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Primary: describe recruitment for Type 1 Diabetes Closed Loop Trial using structured) Tj T*
(age, gender, condition, HbA1c, BMI, and excluded medicine.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Secondary: count screening visits, contact attempts, and reasons a person does not) Tj T*
(continue.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The matching engine does not decide medical eligibility. Screening remains with the) Tj T*
(study team.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. POPULATION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Condition of interest: Type 1 diabetes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Age inclusion: 18 to 45 years at consent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Gender inclusion: Any. If Any, male and female may be listed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HbA1c maximum allowed in the structured record: 9.5.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BMI inclusion window: 18 to 32.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(People outside these numeric windows are not a potential match in the app, except a near) Tj T*
(miss on one numeric field.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. EXCLUSIONS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Excluded medicine for T009: Metformin.) Tj T*
ET
endstream endobj
7 0 obj << /Length 1753 >> stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 770 Td 14 TL
() Tj T*
(If current medicine canonicalizes to Metformin, the medicine criterion fails and the) Tj T*
(trial is not shown as a potential match.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Salt names such as hydrochloride are stripped before that compare. This section is only) Tj T*
(about medicine exclusion.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Pregnancy, inability to attend visits, and missing contact details are recorded by the) Tj T*
(coordinator, not by the matching score.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. VISIT SCHEDULE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Visit 0: phone or clinic pre-screen. Confirm identity and the trial identifier.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Visit 1: screening labs and consent discussion. No result in this file is a diagnosis.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Visit 2: baseline measures for the condition named above.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Visit 3: week 4 safety check.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Visit 4: week 12 primary follow-up.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Visit 5: end of study or early exit. Missed visits are logged in recruitment status) Tj T*
(notes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For T009, visit work follows closed-loop insulin device training.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. ASSESSMENTS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Condition review each visit for Type 1 diabetes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Age is not re-scored after matching unless the coordinator edits the patient record.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HbA1c is compared with the trial maximum 9.5 only in the structured engine.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BMI is compared with 18 to 32.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Ask answers must come from this protocol. Do not invent doses, brands, or extra) Tj T*
(hospitals.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. SAFETY) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Adverse events are reported to the coordinator. This PDF does not list emergency) Tj T*
(treatments.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(People on Metformin stay out of matching for T009.) Tj T*
ET
endstream endobj
